Package: pixelplus
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: PixelPlus contributors <pixelplus@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/tlchandler/PixelPlus
Depends: adduser, systemd, python3 (>= 3.9), avahi-daemon, alsa-utils, ffmpeg, libc6 (>= 2.31)
Recommends: network-manager, dnsmasq-base, nftables, iw, rfkill, i2c-tools, polkitd | policykit-1, logrotate
Suggests: libretro-nestopia
Description: prop-oriented show player for Raspberry Pi pixel controllers
 PixelPlus plays xLights sequences on Raspberry Pi based pixel controllers
 (difftx, difftxlarge, diffsmart boards) with a modern web UI: props instead of
 channels, leader/follower clusters, scheduling, DJ voice clips and games.
 .
 This package contains the pixelplusd daemon, the pixelplus CLI, the web UI,
 systemd units, and - for PixelPlus SD-card images - the pixelplus.txt
 first-boot applier and the Wi-Fi setup hotspot.
